{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Generate Test Framework (TestNG)",
  "description": "Create or update the shared API test framework skeleton with TestNG only. Use this for traditional programmatic tests without BDD/Cucumber.",
  "version": "2",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Follow .kiro/agents/api-test-framework.md with TYPE=testng\n\nThis generates the core TestNG framework WITHOUT BDD/Cucumber infrastructure.\n\nIf api-tests module does NOT exist:\n1. Create api-tests/build.gradle with RestAssured, TestNG, AssertJ, Jackson (NO Cucumber)\n2. Update settings.gradle to include api-tests\n3. Create framework packages: config, clients, xml, soap, endpoints, requests, models, mappers, asserters, headers, utils, testkit, reporting\n4. Create smoke tests\n5. Create snapshot directories (NO features/ directories)\n\nIf api-tests module exists:\n- Modify ONLY required framework classes\n- Do NOT recreate existing files\n\nSCOPE: framework/** only (excluding bdd/). Do NOT generate service-specific tests.\nOUTPUT: Diffs only."
  }
}